      "message": "nit: WDYT about replacing this bool with a string array instead? e.g instead of\n```\ncc_api_variant {\n  export_include_dirs \u003d [\"include\"],\n  export_headers_as_system: true,\n}\n```\n\nwe have,\n```\ncc_api_variant {\n  export_include_dirs \u003d [],\n  export_system_include_dirs \u003d [\"include\"]\n}\n```\n\nllndk struct in Soong\u0027s cc_library currently implements it as a boolean, but the other variants of cc_library implements `exports` as the latter option. The roboleaf bazel rules uses the latter as well https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/build/bazel/+/8aaef82c3933981e3989e84b6f2289f4bb5f9c36:rules/cc/cc_library_shared.bzl;l\u003d59;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0;drc\u003d229cceb2a2a9d118684c53c13661f9a90afce30d",
